    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectLocated? THEN\n\t\t\tDO MoveToObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tDO GrabObject\n\t\tDO CheckObjectProperties\n\t\tDO DoSpecificTask\n\tEND\n"
